config BR2_PACKAGE_IMX_SM
    bool "imx-sm"
    help
        The i.MX System Manager (SM) firmware provides APIs to configure and
        manage various system-level features on i.MX processors, such as
        power management, clock configuration, and security settings.

config BR2_PACKAGE_IMX_SM_CONFIG
    string "i.MX SM Configuration"
    depends on BR2_PACKAGE_IMX_SM
    default "mx95evk"
    help
      Select the target board for which the i.MX System Manager firmware
      should be built. This setting determines the specific configuration
      and features included in the firmware binary.

      Available options:
      - mx95evk: i.MX95 Evaluation Kit
